WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.880
Have you ever wondered what SCP&nbsp;
1867, Lord Blackwood, secretly wants?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:11.040
Foundation researchers snapped a picture of&nbsp;
SCP-1867 with SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.880
while he was relating his discovery of the&nbsp;
ghost of a medieval Crusader deep within&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.040
Burmese territory. This was the result:
“Receiving the Grand Cross of the Order&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:25.120
of the British Empire from Queen Victoria in&nbsp;
a lavish ceremony. Of note is that SCP-1867&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:30.880
is still a sea slug in the picture, as is 'Queen&nbsp;
Victoria'; all other attendees are human.”

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.120
It seems the world’s most adventurous sea slug&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.240
just wants to be recognized&nbsp;
by his peers for his bravery.

